        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fred, Neymar\n- Organizations: Atlético Mineiro, Brazil national football team, Spain national football team\n- Places: Belo Horizonte, Minas Gerais, Brazil\n- Roles: striker\n- Events: 2013 FIFA Confederations Cup Final\n\nFacts:\n- Frederico Chaves Guedes was born on 3 October 1983 and is known as Fred.\n- Fred is a Brazilian professional footballer who plays as a striker for Atlético Mineiro.\n- Atlético Mineiro is a professional football club based in Belo Horizonte, Minas Gerais, Brazil.\n- Atlético Mineiro is commonly known as Atlético Mineiro or Atlético and is colloquially called Galo.\n- In the 2013 FIFA Confederations Cup Final, Brazil defeated Spain 3–0.\n- In the 2013 FIFA Confederations Cup Final, Fred and Neymar scored the goals for Brazil.\n- Brazil's 3–0 win over Spain in the 2013 FIFA Confederations Cup Final ended Spain's record of 29 games without a defeat.",
